# Server API

- Fastify 5 + Zod route schemas via `fastify-type-provider-zod`
- Auth: verify app-issued JWT in middleware; keep secrets in env (`AUTH_JWT_SECRET` or equivalent)
- Keep routes thin — business logic in `services/`
- Efficient DB access: select only needed columns; avoid N+1

## Structure

```
apps/server/src/
  routes/       # HTTP handlers + Zod schemas
  services/     # Domain / persistence logic
  plugins/      # Auth, error handling, etc.
```

## Contracts

- Prefer shared Zod schemas in `packages/shared` (or equivalent) for request/response types used by clients
- Validate env at startup with Zod
- Document pagination and error shape in `docs/architecture/api.md`
